      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metaline_Falls%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from the abundant lead ore, galena, that was first mined in the area in 1869.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metaline_Falls%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1910 the Idaho and Washington Northern Railroad reached Metaline Falls, sparking a boom that led to the town’s incorporation in 1911.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
